
{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Property Listing API",
    "description": "## Role-Based Testing & Admin Credentials\n\nFor security compliance, administrative accounts cannot be registered publicly through the API.\n\nTo test **Admin-only endpoints** (such as viewing all system listings or deleting users), please log in with the pre-configured admin account below:\n\n* **Admin Email:** `admin@example.com`\n* **Admin Password:** `password123`  \n\n### Quick Start Steps for Evaluation:\n1. Execute the **Auth > Login (Admin)** request to generate an Admin JWT token.\n2. The login script will automatically attach this token to all protected endpoints in this collection.\n3. You can now test Admin, Owner, or Buyer routes seamlessly.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://property-listing-32ih.onrender.com/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "propertyId",
      "value": "f5670ec1-2b0c-4c4e-9a2b-b8f38921d3fb",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "b5d4fdb6-5711-480b-9952-e2212f0302e6",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.token);",
                  "} else if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"seller@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"RESET_TOKEN_HERE\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewPassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Properties",
      "item": [
